{"id": "en_blackout_city_p2", "total": 79.31, "segments": [{"text": "Part two. Toxic smoke fills the high stairwell while all emergency alarms remain totally dead.", "start": 0.0, "end": 5.26}, {"text": "Someone downstairs lit emergency candles, sparking an uncontrolled fire across the lower office floors.", "start": 5.62, "end": 10.26}, {"text": "All streetlights and grid power stay dead, leaving the entire city in freezing blackness.", "start": 10.8, "end": 15.04}, {"text": "Jack quickly retreats backward and walks toward his backup office shelter on the safe side.", "start": 15.66, "end": 19.04}, {"text": "Scared workers cough down the hall, but Jack urges everyone to stay low and calm.", "start": 19.54, "end": 22.98}, {"text": "He pulls his team inside the secondary suite and shuts the heavy fire door securely.", "start": 23.48, "end": 26.96}, {"text": "One. Never open doors that feel warm, and seal all door cracks with wet clothing.", "start": 27.51, "end": 31.38}, {"text": "Jack uses his stored water to soak jackets, blocking deadly carbon monoxide from seeping inside.", "start": 31.94, "end": 36.14}, {"text": "Two. Never run a generator, grill or camp stove indoors because carbon monoxide kills silently.", "start": 36.68, "end": 41.56}, {"text": "Panicked survivors downstairs try starting a gas stove, but Jack warns them through the doorway.", "start": 40.989999999999995, "end": 45.62}, {"text": "Three. Conserve battery flashlights and avoid breathing toxic smoke by staying low against the floor.", "start": 46.22, "end": 50.98}, {"text": "Jack clicks his LED flashlight to low power, preserving critical visibility through the pitch dark.", "start": 51.56, "end": 55.58}, {"text": "Remember that a closed fridge keeps food safe 4 hours and full freezers 48 hours.", "start": 56.22, "end": 60.0}, {"text": "Jack shares emergency cold rations and clean bottled water with the stranded workers beside him.", "start": 60.44, "end": 63.92}, {"text": "Sirens finally echo outside as city firefighters battle the blaze and clear the lower floors.", "start": 64.5, "end": 68.26}, {"text": "Fire crews reach Jack's sealed safe room and guide everyone down through the safe stairwell.", "start": 68.8, "end": 72.16}, {"text": "Use flashlights instead of candles during blackouts. Follow for a new scenario tomorrow.", "start": 72.76, "end": 76.16}], "words": [["Part", 0.0, 0.32], ["two.", 0.243, 0.486], ["Toxic", 1.26, 1.54], ["smoke", 1.54, 1.8], ["fills", 1.8, 2.18], ["the", 2.18, 2.42], ["high", 2.42, 2.6], ["stairwell", 2.6, 3.08], ["while", 3.08, 3.3], ["all", 3.3, 3.58], ["emergency", 3.58, 3.9], ["alarms", 3.9, 4.26], ["remain", 4.26, 4.58], ["totally", 4.58, 4.98], ["dead.", 4.98, 5.26], ["Someone", 5.62, 6.04], ["downstairs", 6.04, 6.4], ["lit", 6.4, 6.66], ["emergency", 6.66, 7.02], ["candles,", 7.02, 7.44], ["sparking", 7.44, 8.16], ["an", 8.16, 8.24], ["uncontrolled", 8.24, 8.78], ["fire", 8.78, 9.06], ["across", 9.06, 9.34], ["the", 9.34, 9.52], ["lower", 9.52, 9.66], ["office", 9.66, 10.0], ["floors.", 10.0, 10.26], ["All", 10.8, 11.02], ["streetlights", 10.81, 10.509], ["and", 11.44, 11.66], ["grid", 11.66, 11.82], ["power", 11.82, 12.08], ["stay", 11.83, 11.482], ["dead,", 12.36, 12.64], ["leaving", 12.94, 13.12], ["the", 13.12, 13.28], ["entire", 13.28, 13.56], ["city", 13.56, 13.88], ["in", 13.88, 14.08], ["freezing", 14.08, 14.4], ["blackness.", 14.4, 15.04], ["Jack", 15.66, 15.8], ["quickly", 15.8, 16.12], ["retreats", 16.12, 16.46], ["backward", 16.46, 16.74], ["and", 16.74, 16.94], ["walks", 16.94, 17.16], ["toward", 17.16, 17.36], ["his", 17.36, 17.5], ["backup", 17.37, 16.926], ["office", 17.76, 18.1], ["shelter", 18.1, 18.3], ["on", 18.3, 18.48], ["the", 18.48, 18.58], ["safe", 18.58, 18.76], ["side.", 18.76, 19.04], ["Scared", 19.54, 19.76], ["workers", 19.76, 20.0], ["cough", 20.0, 20.26], ["down", 20.26, 20.44], ["the", 20.44, 20.6], ["hall,", 20.6, 20.72], ["but", 21.0, 21.08], ["Jack", 21.08, 21.26], ["urges", 21.26